        "TileImage": "$($repository cafb2bda-485c-4c11-9df0-c1e6971dbbbb).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning, 47. American suburb of manicured lawns, white picket fences, and quiet streets. However, beneath this suburban bliss lies petty malice, fragile egos, and deeply unsettling culinary secrets.\r\rA jogger whose offensive cardiovascular health threatens the American lifestyle and one of our clients, an American fast-food chain.\r\rA petty guard marked for double-dipping into communal guacamole.\r\rA grandmotherly figure whose famous meat pies secretly contain the missing local resident.",
